classes.description:
$quittio = Quittio::create(Config::fromArray([...]), [new CountryDE]);
    $result = $quittio->make($invoice)->format('zugferd')->render();

Every run calculates the data, chooses format and profile, validates, writes the XML,
renders the template and produces the PDF/A with the embedded XML.

- invoices of small businesses (Meta::FLAG_SMALL_BUSINESS): the small business preset of the
  seller's country pack (CountryDefaults::$smallBusinessVatPreset, Germany: de.small_business),
  otherwise $preset;
- all other invoices: $preset, otherwise the preset of the seller's country pack
  (CountryDefaults::$vatPreset, Germany: de.standard_19).

InvoiceBuilder::useDefaultVat(new CountryDefaultVat($quittio->countries()));

properties.default:
'quittio:benchmark
        {--count=20 : Number of runs per format}
        {--scenario=simple : Sample scenario}
        {--format=* : Formats, default: cii and zugferd}'

'quittio:codelists:update
        {xsl? : EN16931-CII-validation.xsl of the validator configuration}
        {--target= : Output directory, default: the code lists of quittio/core}'

'quittio:install
        {--views : Also publish the Blade templates}
        {--fonts : Also publish the fonts}
        {--managed : Also install the Managed layer (requires quittio/managed)}
        {--force : Overwrite existing files}'

'quittio:preview
        {--scenario=simple : Sample scenario (simple, many-lines, long-texts, mixed-vat, reverse-charge, ...)}
        {--template= : Blade view of the template}
        {--format=pdf : pdf or html}
        {--locale= : Locale of the labels}
        {--output= : Target file; default storage/app/quittio/preview}'

'quittio:render
        {invoice? : Stored invoice of the Managed layer (number, UUID or id)}
        {--json= : JSON file with invoice data (InvoiceData::toJson())}
        {--format= : Output format, default: automatic choice}
        {--profile= : Profile}
        {--output= : Target directory or file}'

'quittio:schemas:download
        {--path= : Target directory, default storage/quittio/validators}
        {--force : Download again}
        {--without-peppol : Skip compiling the Peppol BIS Billing 3.0 rules (needs Java)}
        {--java=java : Java binary for compiling the Peppol rules}'

'quittio:validate
        {file : XML or PDF file}
        {--profile= : Expected profile}
        {--kosit : Also run the KoSIT validator (configured in quittio.validation.drivers.kosit)}
        {--verapdf : Also run veraPDF (configured in quittio.validation.drivers.verapdf)}
        {--json : Print the result as JSON}'
